{"41":[{"k":"p","t":"6-3-1"},{"k":"p","t":"1."},{"k":"h","t":"Coin Options"},{"k":"p","t":"Select \u201cCOIN OPTIONS\u201d on the menu screen to set the game cost and related settings. The following screen is displayed."},{"k":"p","t":"COIN OPTIONS [DEFAULT IN GREEN]"},{"k":"tr","t":"GAME COST   1 COIN (S) 1 CREDIT   (a)"},{"k":"tr","t":"CONTINUE COST   1: COIN (S) 1 CREDIT   (b)"},{"k":"tr","t":"FREE PLAY   OFF   (c)"},{"k":"p","t":"EXIT"},{"k":"p","t":"SELECT SW: CHOOSE ENTER SW: ENTER"},{"k":"p","t":"Use the Select Up/Down switch to choose the required item then press the Enter button."},{"k":"p","t":"Use the Select Up/Down switch to change the setting."},{"k":"p","t":"Select \u201cEXIT\u201d and press the Enter button to return to the menu screen."},{"k":"note","t":"Note:- The price of play on this machine is set within the Cashflow Coin Mech. Ensure that the Game Cost is set to 1 Coin 1 Credit."},{"k":"h","t":"Item Description Pre-Set"},{"k":"li","t":"(a) Game Cost Coins required for number of credits - - - - - settable 1~9 1 Coin 1 Credit"},{"k":"li","t":"(b) Continue Cost | Coins required to continue - - - - - settable 1~9 1 Coin 1 Credit"},{"k":"li","t":"(c) Free Play No coins required for credit - - - - - On (Yes) / Off (No) OFF"}],"49":[{"k":"p","t":"6-3-5 Sound Test"},{"k":"p","t":"1. Select \u201cSOUND TEST\u201d on the menu screen to test the audio and adjust the volume settings. The following screen is displayed."},{"k":"p","t":"SOUND TEST [DEFAULT IN GREEN]"},{"k":"tr","t":"VOLUME ALLSP   (0~127)   080   (a)"},{"k":"p","t":"ATTRACT (0~127) 064 (b)"},{"k":"tr","t":"REQUEST   SONG NO.   000   (c)"},{"k":"tr","t":"MESSAGE   wanwnennee   (d)"},{"k":"p","t":"EXIT"},{"k":"p","t":"SELECT SW : CHOOSE ENTER SW: ENTER SERVICESW : REQUEST ON/OFF"},{"k":"p","t":"Use the Select Up/Down switch to choose the required item then press the Enter button."},{"k":"p","t":"Use the Up/Down switch to change the setting."},{"k":"p","t":"Press the Enter button to return to item select mode."},{"k":"p","t":"Select \u201cEXIT\u201d and press the Enter button to return to the menu screen."},{"k":"p","t":"VOLUME ALL SP The volume levels of all speakers, during play mode, will be adjusted at the same time with the balance between front and rear speakers being set automatically. [0~127, DEFAULT = 80]"},{"k":"p","t":"VOLUME ATTRACT The volume levels of all speakers, during attract mode, will be adjusted at the same time with the balance between speakers being set automatically. [0~127, DEFAULT = 64]"},{"k":"p","t":"REQUEST SONG No."},{"k":"h","t":"Each number produces a different sound each time the service"},{"k":"p","t":"button is pressed. (The sound will turn off after approx 10 seconds)"},{"k":"p","t":"Number 001 will produce a stereo test. Sound will be produced from the left speaker then the right speaker and then both speakers. The message on the screen will display which speaker is active."},{"k":"p","t":"Displays details of the Request Song No selected."}],"50":[{"k":"p","t":"6-3-6 ADS Data"},{"k":"p","t":"By selecting ADS Data from the menu screen, all of the bookkeeping details can be read and/or reset."},{"k":"p","t":"6-3-7 Others"},{"k":"li","t":"1. Select \u201cOTHERS\u201d on the menu screen. The following screen is displayed."},{"k":"p","t":"OTHERS [DEFAULT IN GREEN]"},{"k":"tr","t":"ROM Ver. 00/09/20   WED 15:15:59   (a)"},{"k":"tr","t":"CLOCK   --/--/--   \u2014   eet   (b)"},{"k":"tr","t":"SIN   000000-   123456   (c)"},{"k":"p","t":"LANGUAGE ENG (d)"},{"k":"tr","t":"PAUSE   OFF   (e)"},{"k":"p","t":"NAOMI TEST MODE (f) BACKUP MEMORY INITIALIZE (g)"},{"k":"p","t":"EXIT"},{"k":"p","t":"SELECT SW: CHOOSE ENTER SW: ENTER"},{"k":"li","t":"2. Use the Select Up/Down switch to choose the required item then press the Enter button."},{"k":"li","t":"3. Select \u201cEXIT\u201d and press the Enter button to return to the menu screen."}],"69":[{"k":"h","t":"Item Description Part No"},{"k":"tr","t":"3   Speaker Grille   47000368"},{"k":"tr